TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-2509.02354v2
AU  - MCPHAIL-SNYDER, CALVIN
AU  - RESHETIKHIN, NICOLAI
TI  - The holonomy braiding for U_xi(sl2) in terms of geometric quantum dilogarithms
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.02354
AB  - We derive an explicit formula for the holonomy R-matrix of quantum sl2 at a root of unity. We show it factorizes into a product of four quantum dilogarithms and satisfies a holonomy Yang-Baxter equation. This factorization extends previously known results and we collect many existing results needed for our computation.
ER  - 
